  "summary": "Predeclared12 matched synthetic streams,6 prices,3 policies,216 trajectories and150984 decisions. Legacy v0, rolling-target/unpriced control and priced partial v1 compared with common pre-action prediction and declared per-update cost diagnostics. V1 mean prediction MSE exceeds legacy at all six matched prices, while update frequency and operational recovery vary with price. At c=.06 mean MSE v0=.1211697, control=.1292312, v1=.1434048 and recovery failures=.1875,.2708333,.625 under the declared criterion. Exact legacy/v1 reference controls match; v1 action accounting error0. No optimum, universal dominance or calibration claim.",
  "title": "Matched promotion-price comparison after exact action pricing"
}
